  missionDescription: 'FIRST SIGNAL

    The ranger network went silent during a
    sealed cargo transfer. Restore the relays, recover the patrol''s last transmission,
    and get out with the evidence.'
  victoryDescription: 'The patrol log points to the Outpost refinery.

    Follow
    the cargo trail before the signal disappears.'
